Bundled data under other terms
------------------------------
assets/stars.bin, assets/star_names.txt, assets/variables.txt
  Derived from the HYG Database v4.1 by David Nash (astronexus),
  https://github.com/astronexus/HYG-Database
  Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 (CC BY-SA 4.0).
  Modifications: filtered to V <= 10, converted to binary (RA, Dec, V, B-V)
  sorted by magnitude; proper names and variable-star designations with
  magnitude ranges extracted to text. These derived files are shared under
  CC BY-SA 4.0.

assets/dso.txt
  Derived from OpenNGC by Mattia Verga and contributors,
  https://github.com/mattiaverga/OpenNGC
  Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 (CC BY-SA 4.0).
  Modifications: NGC.csv and addendum.csv merged; duplicate, non-existent,
  single/double-star and "other" entries removed; positions converted to
  radians; fields reduced to designation, type, position, magnitude, size,
  position angle, Messier number and first common name. Shared under
  CC BY-SA 4.0.

assets/neo.bin, assets/neo_names.txt
  Derived from the IAU Minor Planet Center's NEA orbit file (NEA.txt,
  snapshot with osculating epoch 2026 Jun 9), https://minorplanetcenter.net
  This research has made use of data and/or services provided by the
  International Astronomical Union's Minor Planet Center.
  Modifications: converted to binary (epoch, a, e, i, node, perihelion
  argument, mean anomaly, H, G, flags) with readable designations.

assets/coast.bin
  Derived from Natural Earth 1:110m coastlines, https://www.naturalearthdata.com
  Public domain.

Runtime dependencies (egui/eframe, tiny_http, serde, png, …) are under their
own permissive licences; see each crate's metadata (`cargo tree`).
